# ===== The Veil, task 4: Distortion's Double and Withdraw's swap =====
# Spec 3.3 / D9. Goals: goals/ARCANA_Spell_Withdraw.txt, goals/ARCANA_Spell_MimicWithdraw.txt and the "Task 4" edits in
# goals/ARCANA_Deceiver_Doubles.txt. Details and the reasons: 40_distortion.md.
#
# Distortion and Mimic: Distortion now SUMMON a Double (the Mirror Image shape, through DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH, so the Doubles
# goal registers it and it counts toward the cap) instead of the old marker item. The summon is a GROUND functor: it lands
# where she lands, and Osiris (DB_ARCANA_DoubleHome) moves it to the spot she left. No spell field has to place it.
# Withdraw and Mimic: Withdraw can only be cast while their helper status is on her: Osiris applies it when the Double is
# bound and removes it when that Double goes, so a Withdraw with no Double cannot be cast and costs nothing.
# Needs 20_doubles.patch (DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH) applied (it is, since apply session 1).

# ---------- Text ----------
# Existing handles, rewritten (the swap replaces the teleport back). The Extra lines are new.
@loca ha600849fgd60bg0304g0ae8gd0576ef7fa29 Dash through space, dealing damage where you arrive, and leave a Double standing where you were. For 2 turns, you can cast <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Arcana_Created_Withdraw">Withdraw</LSTag> to swap places with it.
@loca hea3258c7g78a8g47c1g40cbg1263fd6d0156 Recast <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion">Distortion</LSTag> to dash through space, dealing damage where you arrive, and leave a Double standing where you were. For 2 turns, you can cast <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Arcana_Created_MimicWithdraw">Withdraw</LSTag> to swap places with it.
@loca h62eccccagdbe3g230bg3715g97e90882e0c1 Swap places with the Double you left behind.
@loca DISTORT_DOUBLE_EXTRA The Double counts toward the number of Doubles you can have. If it is destroyed, Withdraw is lost.
@loca WITHDRAW_DOUBLE_EXTRA Cannot be used once the Double has been destroyed.

# ---------- Distortion: the Double replaces the marker item ----------
# Old: GROUND:Summon(SELF,c3c514b2-...,2) = a 2-turn marker item at the origin (templates c3c514b2 / d88fb323 stay in the
# mod, now unused). New: the Mirror Image summon (template 8807d230 = the Double, permanent, no stack id so several coexist,
# status DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH with her as the cause). It stays FIRST in the list, as the marker was. Everything else in
# each line (teleport, explosion with the variant's own dice, the Last Cast marker) is copied unchanged from the live value.
@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_Distortion_Explosion);GROUND:ApplyStatus(SELF,DISTORTION_LAST_CASTED,100,-1)
@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion_4 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_Distortion_Explosion_4);GROUND:ApplyStatus(SELF,DISTORTION_LAST_CASTED,100,-1)
@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion_5 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_Distortion_Explosion_5);GROUND:ApplyStatus(SELF,DISTORTION_LAST_CASTED,100,-1)
@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion_6 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_Distortion_Explosion_6);GROUND:ApplyStatus(SELF,DISTORTION_LAST_CASTED,100,-1)
@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion ExtraDescription {{DISTORT_DOUBLE_EXTRA}}

# Mimic: Distortion: the root and the variants _4.._6 each carry their own explosion line, like Distortion (same replacement).
@set Target_Arcana_Created_MimicDistortion SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_MimicDistortion_Explosion);
@set Target_Arcana_Created_MimicDistortion_4 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_MimicDistortion_Explosion_4);
@set Target_Arcana_Created_MimicDistortion_5 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_MimicDistortion_Explosion_5);
@set Target_Arcana_Created_MimicDistortion_6 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:IF(CanStand('')):TeleportSource();GROUND:CreateExplosion(Projectile_Arcana_MimicDistortion_Explosion_6);

# ---------- Withdraw: only while its Double lives ----------
# DISTORTION_HELPER / MIMIC_DISTORTION_HELPER already lock Distortion / Mimic: Distortion while a window is open. The
# goals now apply them when the Double is BOUND (not when the spell starts) and remove them when it is lost, so the
# same status also tells the stats "a Double is waiting". The variants _3.._6 `using` the root and inherit this;
# Mimic: Withdraw uses the root, so it needs its own line.
@set Shout_Arcana_Created_Withdraw RequirementConditions HasStatus('DISTORTION_HELPER')
@set Shout_Arcana_Created_Withdraw ExtraDescription {{WITHDRAW_DOUBLE_EXTRA}}
@set Shout_Arcana_Created_MimicWithdraw RequirementConditions HasStatus('MIMIC_DISTORTION_HELPER')
